  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation TVET - Decent Jobs Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: TVET - Decent Jobs Action - This action aims to support decent jobs in Myanmar&#xbf;s garment sector by promoting responsible business practices, improving working conditions and providing better skills and employability opportunities. The initiative seeks to strengthen economic resilience while ensuring that growth aligns with social and environmental standards. In addition, this action will assist EU garment sector operating in Myanmar in responding to the expectations of the recently adopted EU legislation on corporate sustainability, including the Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD), the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) and the Forced Labour Regulation (FLR) where relevant.</narrative>
  </description>
